The SessionListTool loads all messages for each session to count them and find the last message timestamp (line 63). This can be inefficient if sessions have many messages. For large sessions, this operation could be slow and resource-intensive. Consider optimizing by either storing message counts in session metadata or using a more efficient method to get the last message timestamp without loading all messages.
```suggestion
      let messageCount = 0
      let last: number | undefined = undefined
      for (const msg of msgs) {
